-### Security notes and known limit
+###### Security notes and known limit
 - Webhook: token compared in constant time, one generic 401 for every failure, rate limited (120/min), body capped.
 - Idempotent: every SMS has a fingerprint (serial + amount + time); forwarder retries create no second row or credit.
 - Every decision is audited (`payment.bank_sms_matched`, `bank_sms.source_saved`, `bank_sms.token_rotated`).
@@ -75,13 +99,13 @@ All eleven receipt/SMS pairs of the owner (Blu bank x3, Bank Melli x2, Bank Mell
   resolved only by the claimed time; if only one of them uploaded a receipt, that receipt is paid. Keep
   `require_claimed_time` on, set `max_auto_amount_rial`, and use unique amounts or small windows for high-value stores.
 
-### OCR settings in the panel
+###### OCR settings in the panel
 Admin -> Settings -> "خواندن خودکار رسید (OCR)" chooses the engine (vision / tesseract / auto / off), the vision API key (stored Fernet-encrypted,
 write-only, never returned or audited), model, service URL (https only), timeout and tesseract languages, and has a live connection test
 (`PUT /admin/integrations/receipt-ocr`, `POST .../test`). A panel-saved config wins; until then the `MELORIN_RECEIPT_OCR_*` env values apply.
 The OCR config is platform-wide: reseller stores use the same engine.
 
-### Time-boxed manual review (provisional credit)
+###### Time-boxed manual review (provisional credit)
 Anything ambiguous goes to manual review. The customer must not wait for an offline human: when a receipt has waited `minutes` (default 5)
 without a decision, `receipt_grace_job` (every minute) credits the wallet **provisionally** and the payment moves to a fast-review queue
 (`payment.meta.provisional.state = open`). A human then **confirms** (credit stays) or **revokes** (ledger reversal `payment:<id>:provisional_revoke`,
@@ -96,7 +120,7 @@ arrives later and matches the payment confirms it automatically.
   The plain payment-review route also resolves a provisional payment.
 * Residual risk: a forged receipt can hold a provisional credit for up to the review time and the cap; keep the caps low.
 
-### Duplicate receipt picture (fingerprint check)
+###### Duplicate receipt picture (fingerprint check)
 Independent of the bank SMS: at upload time the picture is compared with every earlier receipt by two fingerprints stored in
 `payment_receipt_fingerprints` - the `sha256` of the bytes (computed by Core, trusted) and Telegram's `file_unique_id` (sent by the bot; it also
 catches the same picture re-sent from another chat, where the bytes differ after Telegram re-compresses it). It helps receipts that have no SMS
@@ -116,15 +140,15 @@ catches the same picture re-sent from another chat, where the bytes differ after
 * Known limits: a picture edited pixel-wise (re-screenshot, crop) has another hash - the SMS/reference check remains the proof; `file_unique_id` is
   client-supplied, so it is advisory next to the hash; two simultaneous uploads of one picture can both pass `block` (no unique constraint, by design).
 
